Route41_Text_SwimmerMGeorgeIntro::
	.string "I’m a bit tired.\n"
	.string "If I win, lend me your POKéMON.$"

Route41_Text_SwimmerMGeorgeDefeat::
	.string "Pant, pant...$"

Route41_Text_SwimmerMGeorge::
	.string "It’s so far to CIANWOOD.\p"
	.string "But it’s no easy return trip to\n"
	.string "OLIVINE either.\p"
	.string "What should I do?$"

Route41_Text_SwimmerMCharlieIntro::
	.string "The water’s warm here. I’m loose\n"
	.string "and limber.\p"
	.string "Sure, I’ll take you on!$"

Route41_Text_SwimmerMCharlieDefeat::
	.string "Yikes! I’ve got prune skin!$"

Route41_Text_SwimmerMCharlie::
	.string "Isn’t it relaxing just floating like\n"
	.string "this?$"

Route41_Text_SwimmerFKayleeIntro::
	.string "I’m on my way to WHIRL ISLANDS.\n"
	.string "I’m going exploring with friends.$"

Route41_Text_SwimmerFKayleeDefeat::
	.string "Is that how you do it?$"

Route41_Text_SwimmerFKaylee::
	.string "There’s supposed to be a big\n"
	.string "POKéMON deep beneath WHIRL\l"
	.string "ISLANDS.\p"
	.string "I wonder what it could be?$"

Route41_Text_SwimmerFSusieIntro::
	.string "You look so elegant, riding your\n"
	.string "POKéMON.$"

Route41_Text_SwimmerFSusieDefeat::
	.string "I’m crushed...$"

Route41_Text_SwimmerFSusie::
	.string "Wasn’t there a hit song about a boy\n"
	.string "riding a LAPRAS?$"

Route41_Text_SwimmerFKaraIntro::
	.string "If you need to rest, just tread\n"
	.string "water.\p"
	.string "You’ll get your wind back, so you\n"
	.string "can keep on going strong.$"

Route41_Text_SwimmerFKaraDefeat::
	.string "Oh! You have more energy than I do.$"

Route41_Text_SwimmerFKara::
	.string "I heard roars from deep inside the\n"
	.string "ISLANDS.$"

Route41_Text_SwimmerMKirkIntro::
	.string "The waves are wild here.\n"
	.string "They tire you out while you swim.$"

Route41_Text_SwimmerMKirkDefeat::
	.string "I’m beat!$"

Route41_Text_SwimmerMKirk::
	.string "The currents keep me from reaching\n"
	.string "that island.$"

Route41_Text_SwimmerMBerkeIntro::
	.string "See those islands that are blocked\n"
	.string "by whilpools?\p"
	.string "There just has to be a secret!$"

Route41_Text_SwimmerMBerkeDefeat::
	.string "What’s the secret to your strength?$"

Route41_Text_SwimmerMBerke::
	.string "It was a dark and stormy night...\p"
	.string "I saw this giant POKéMON flying\n"
	.string "from the islands.\p"
	.string "It was scattering feathers from its\n"
	.string "silver wings.$"

Route41_Text_SwimmerFDeniseIntro::
	.string "The weather is so beautiful, I’m in\n"
	.string "a daze!$"

Route41_Text_SwimmerFDeniseDefeat::
	.string "Ohhh!$"

Route41_Text_SwimmerFDenise::
	.string "A sunburn is the worst for skin.\p"
	.string "But I don’t use a sunblock.\n"
	.string "I won’t pollute the water.$"

Route41_Text_SwimmerMMathewIntro::
	.string "Are you seeking the secrets of\n"
	.string "WHIRL ISLANDS?$"

Route41_Text_SwimmerMMathewDefeat::
	.string "Ooh, you’ve got great endurance!$"

Route41_Text_SwimmerMMathew::
	.string "A secret about WHIRL ISLANDS...\p"
	.string "It’s pitch-black inside!$"

Route41_Text_SwimmerFWendyIntro::
	.string "At night, STARYU gather near the\n"
	.string "water’s surface.$"

Route41_Text_SwimmerFWendyDefeat::
	.string "Oh, dear...$"

Route41_Text_SwimmerFWendy::
	.string "The clusters of STARYU light up\n"
	.string "at the same time.\p"
	.string "It’s so beautiful, it’s scary.$"

Route41_Text_LaprasDoll::
	.string "This looks live a very heavy\n"
	.string "rock. But, there’s something fishy\l"
	.string "about it...$"
